WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.170
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.440 --> 00:12.039
[Episode 2]

3
00:15.273 --> 00:16.720
I'll take you to the VIP lounge. This way.

4
00:16.720 --> 00:18.073
All right.

5
00:20.413 --> 00:22.220
The casinos in Shenzhen are bigger,

6
00:22.220 --> 00:25.500
but they haven't got Hai City's old-school charm.

7
00:25.500 --> 00:28.259
Glad you like it, Mr. Zhou.

8
00:28.259 --> 00:29.740
Long time no see, Mr. Chen.

9
00:29.740 --> 00:31.139
This is Mr. Zhou.

10
00:31.139 --> 00:33.380
He's from Shenzhen and enjoys a flutter.

11
00:33.380 --> 00:35.820
Yun, please look after him.

12
00:35.820 --> 00:37.500
So, it's your first time here.

13
00:37.500 --> 00:40.020
- It is. - Then you must get the full experience.

14
00:40.020 --> 00:41.340
This way, please.

15
00:45.179 --> 00:46.900
- Have a seat. - Thanks.

16
00:46.900 --> 00:48.700
Please sit, Mr. Chen.

17
00:49.499 --> 00:50.539
- Enjoy yourselves. - We will.

18
00:50.539 --> 00:52.820
Just ask if you need anything.

19
01:05.620 --> 01:07.180
Raise by 10,000.

20
01:11.419 --> 01:13.379
Mr. Chen, are you in?

21
01:13.379 --> 01:14.780
Of course.

22
01:15.499 --> 01:17.099
Right, carry on.

23
01:18.939 --> 01:20.260
Again.

24
01:28.379 --> 01:29.779
All in.

25
01:29.779 --> 01:32.820
Mr. Chen, are you calling?

26
01:32.820 --> 01:34.299
I have to keep up with you.

27
01:34.299 --> 01:35.340
Good.

28
01:35.340 --> 01:36.659
Carry on.

29
01:42.499 --> 01:44.140
A spade flush.

30
01:45.500 --> 01:47.379
Interesting.

31
01:47.379 --> 01:49.979
Thanks for going easy on me, Mr.. Chen.

32
01:49.979 --> 01:50.980
Again.

33
01:50.980 --> 01:52.939
I'm off to the washroom. Carry on.

34
01:52.939 --> 01:54.860
All right. Let's continue.

35
01:59.460 --> 02:01.340
Sorry, sir. A VIP has booked the place tonight.

36
02:01.340 --> 02:03.459
Please use the washroom on the other side.

37
02:06.100 --> 02:07.579
Security at the VIP lounge was too tight.

38
02:07.579 --> 02:08.820
I couldn't get in.

39
02:08.820 --> 02:11.980
Next time, Zhao Sheng Ge won't be so lucky.

40
02:14.579 --> 02:16.819
I see. Got it.

41
02:24.620 --> 02:27.180
So, he's tonight's VIP.

42
02:27.180 --> 02:30.259
Lay a finger on him and you're dead.

43
02:30.259 --> 02:31.860
I understand. Yes.

44
02:31.860 --> 02:33.499
I'll kill him next time.

45
02:33.499 --> 02:35.220
Got it.

46
02:55.539 --> 02:57.300
What are you doing?

47
02:57.300 --> 03:00.060
Open the bloody door!

48
03:00.060 --> 03:03.979
Mr. Chen, you didn't tell me he was back.

49
03:03.979 --> 03:05.148
That's right.

50
03:05.892 --> 03:07.292
He's back.

51
03:07.979 --> 03:10.979
But my life probably won't change much.

52
03:10.979 --> 03:12.620
The joy and the pain,

53
03:12.620 --> 03:14.900
the comfort and the unease...

54
03:14.900 --> 03:16.459
They're all mine.

55
03:16.459 --> 03:18.665
I'm in control of everything.

56
03:18.665 --> 03:21.205
I decide everything.

57
03:21.205 --> 03:24.579
You're sure his presence won't affect you?

58
03:25.220 --> 03:26.668
It won't.

59
03:29.146 --> 03:31.219
I had a wonderful time tonight.

60
03:31.219 --> 03:33.940
You're quite a character, Mr. Chen.

61
03:34.779 --> 03:37.219
Glad you enjoyed yourself, Mr. Zhou. Take care.

62
03:37.219 --> 03:38.820
All right.

63
05:20.740 --> 05:22.660
Is that bloke mad?

64
06:09.620 --> 06:11.860
He's certainly got a temper.

65
06:29.120 --> 06:30.920
[Patent]

66
06:30.920 --> 06:32.520
[Certificate of Achievement]

67
06:53.540 --> 06:55.139
Wan.

68
06:57.019 --> 06:58.619
Have you eaten?

69
06:59.579 --> 07:00.860
I've eaten.

70
07:02.019 --> 07:03.699
Look at the state of you.

71
07:03.699 --> 07:05.460
You don't look like you've eaten.

72
07:10.140 --> 07:11.140
This bowl...

73
07:11.140 --> 07:12.180
Back when we'd just met,

74
07:12.180 --> 07:13.259
you dragged me to a roadside stall.

75
07:13.259 --> 07:15.100
I ate three bowls straight.

76
07:15.100 --> 07:16.259
Nearly burst.

77
07:16.259 --> 07:18.499
You spent all your pocket money

78
07:18.499 --> 07:20.860
and still owed the owner three yuan.

79
07:23.540 --> 07:25.499
How long since you slept?

80
07:28.180 --> 07:29.739
I've slept.

81
07:33.259 --> 07:35.100
For how long?

82
07:55.300 --> 07:56.899
Chen Wan.

83
07:56.899 --> 07:58.980
Do you think I'm an idiot?

84
08:03.180 --> 08:06.100
Back when Zhuo Sheng Yan pushed me into the water,

85
08:06.100 --> 08:08.300
everyone else just stood there watching.

86
08:08.300 --> 08:09.699
You were the only one who jumped in to save me.

87
08:09.699 --> 08:11.300
From that moment,

88
08:11.300 --> 08:14.420
I thought of you as my very best friend.

89
08:14.420 --> 08:15.579
What about you?

90
08:15.579 --> 08:17.379
What am I to you?

91
08:17.379 --> 08:19.725
Have you ever seen me as a friend?

92
08:24.499 --> 08:28.819
I've always known that you seem easy-going,

93
08:28.819 --> 08:30.660
but you're stubborn as hell.

94
08:30.660 --> 08:33.019
Once you set your mind on something or someone,

95
08:33.019 --> 08:35.459
nothing can pull you away.

96
08:35.459 --> 08:36.939
Since he came back,

97
08:36.939 --> 08:38.300
no matter where he is or how far away,

98
08:38.300 --> 08:40.740
you go running to him.

99
08:40.740 --> 08:42.459
Most of the time, he's not even there.

100
08:42.459 --> 08:44.780
Then you come back and work yourself to death.

101
08:44.780 --> 08:47.300
I'm not asking you to give him up.

102
08:47.300 --> 08:48.660
But promise me this much.

103
08:48.660 --> 08:51.060
Look after yourself.

104
08:57.619 --> 08:59.499
What do you like about him?

105
09:02.900 --> 09:04.619
Everything. He doesn't know it.

106
09:04.619 --> 09:06.379
And that's for the best.

107
09:09.060 --> 09:12.459
Best, my ass. What's so good about him?

108
09:12.459 --> 09:14.860
Just seeing him is enough.

109
09:16.060 --> 09:19.739
Even if it's only once in ten tries?

110
09:27.380 --> 09:28.579
Xuan.

111
09:28.579 --> 09:30.100
Do you know?

112
09:31.140 --> 09:35.099
In the end, I live in a world without Zhao Sheng Ge.

113
09:35.099 --> 09:36.459
He's on the mountain peak.

114
09:36.459 --> 09:38.379
I'm at the bottom of the valley.

115
09:39.339 --> 09:42.540
One glimpse from afar is enough.

116
09:42.540 --> 09:47.499
Even once in ten tries would make me lucky.

117
09:48.300 --> 09:49.739
Chen Wan.

118
09:51.180 --> 09:52.699
What if Zhao Sheng Ge finds out one day?

119
09:52.699 --> 09:54.220
He won't.

120
09:54.979 --> 09:56.260
All I need is for him to be safe

121
09:56.260 --> 09:58.820
and alive in this world.

122
10:07.540 --> 10:10.300
Enough of that rubbish.

123
10:11.579 --> 10:13.539
Get eating.

124
10:17.219 --> 10:19.699
I've opened a new hotel on Miwang Road.

125
10:19.699 --> 10:22.939
I've invited all the young masters of Hai City.

126
10:22.939 --> 10:26.580
This Saturday, you have to be there.

127
10:27.339 --> 10:30.900
A fortune-teller said I need someone

128
10:30.900 --> 10:33.420
born under a Wu-Wu water sign.

129
10:33.420 --> 10:35.900
Their fate must be harmonious,

130
10:35.900 --> 10:38.300
with their lucky element strong this month.

131
10:38.300 --> 10:40.300
That's you.

132
10:41.140 --> 10:43.339
Business folks in Hai City

133
10:43.339 --> 10:45.699
seem very particular about this stuff.

134
10:45.699 --> 10:47.579
You don't know the half of it.

135
10:47.579 --> 10:49.900
Zhuo Yu Jian and Zhuo Sheng Yan

136
10:49.900 --> 10:52.780
are waiting to see me fail.

137
10:52.780 --> 10:55.300
I need to show them I've got friends and standing.

138
10:55.300 --> 10:56.420
Don't worry.

139
10:56.420 --> 10:57.899
I'll be there.

140
10:59.979 --> 11:02.219
I've invited Zhao Sheng Ge, too.

141
11:02.219 --> 11:04.340
But I don't know if he'll come.

142
11:05.660 --> 11:07.739
I've seen him once already.

143
11:08.819 --> 11:11.619
Nine more wasted trips won't hurt.

144
11:14.979 --> 11:16.779
I don't understand.

145
11:18.780 --> 11:22.259
You will when you meet the right person.

146
11:31.459 --> 11:34.260
Plan this private room's menu separately.

147
11:34.260 --> 11:36.780
Choose dishes with local flavour.

148
11:36.780 --> 11:38.540
Nothing that's all style and no substance.

149
11:38.540 --> 11:40.459
Keep it homely, but authentic.

150
11:40.459 --> 11:42.859
- Right. - This table is for close friends.

151
11:42.859 --> 11:45.780
Have that Italian chef and the seven-star chef from the mainland

152
11:45.780 --> 11:48.860
cook alongside the local chefs themselves.

153
11:49.660 --> 11:52.500
The temperature, humidity,

154
11:52.500 --> 11:54.660
tea, tea service, and fruit platter here

155
11:54.660 --> 11:55.780
must be exactly as I said.

156
11:55.780 --> 11:57.380
- Understood. - Oh, one more thing.

157
11:57.380 --> 11:58.380
Xuan.

158
11:58.380 --> 12:00.699
That prized top-grade Da Hong Pao of yours...

159
12:00.699 --> 12:03.380
Time to contribute it, yeah?

160
12:03.380 --> 12:05.420
Right. Of course.

161
12:05.420 --> 12:07.659
If not now, when?

162
12:11.140 --> 12:13.660
Put these people here.

163
12:13.660 --> 12:15.099
They're friendly with the Zhuo family,

164
12:15.099 --> 12:16.939
so it'll be easier to talk.

165
12:16.939 --> 12:20.099
Put these guests here.

166
12:20.099 --> 12:22.899
The view is good, and they prefer quiet.

167
12:22.899 --> 12:24.740
Right. I'll arrange it like this.

168
12:24.740 --> 12:26.619
Thanks. Call any time if you need me.

169
12:26.619 --> 12:27.739
All right.

170
12:33.459 --> 12:35.100
What are you looking at me for?

171
12:36.780 --> 12:38.819
Zhao Sheng Ge really is blind.

172
12:38.819 --> 12:40.580
He can't see a thing.

173
12:42.020 --> 12:43.099
Stop worrying about me.

174
12:43.099 --> 12:44.820
Worry about yourself.

175
12:52.859 --> 12:55.900
I reckon he won't come today either.

176
12:55.900 --> 12:58.659
Sounds like he's elsewhere discussing a deal.

177
12:59.660 --> 13:01.100
It doesn't matter.

178
13:02.060 --> 13:04.019
I'm only here to help you.

179
13:16.219 --> 13:18.579
How have you been?

180
13:18.579 --> 13:19.939
Long time no see.

181
13:19.939 --> 13:21.339
Help yourselves.

182
13:21.339 --> 13:22.619
Over here.

183
13:32.819 --> 13:36.060
Mr. Tan, Mr. Shen.

184
13:36.060 --> 13:38.780
Your presence truly brightens the place.

185
13:38.780 --> 13:41.579
Since you're here, I had to come in person.

186
13:41.579 --> 13:44.819
They need to know Xuan has people behind him.

187
13:44.819 --> 13:46.300
Hello, Mr. Chen.

188
14:16.260 --> 14:17.660
Congratulations.

189
14:17.660 --> 14:19.300
Thank you.

190
14:19.300 --> 14:20.540
Perfect timing.

191
14:20.540 --> 14:21.660
We're about to eat.

192
14:21.660 --> 14:23.180
Let me tell you, our table today

193
14:23.180 --> 14:25.260
is nothing like the others.

194
14:25.260 --> 14:27.391
Wan chose everything so carefully...

195
14:29.660 --> 14:31.939
- What? - He's left again?

196
14:31.939 --> 14:33.579
Oh, I said we're about to eat.

197
14:33.579 --> 14:35.500
Let's go.

198
14:35.500 --> 14:36.729
Come on.

199
14:43.739 --> 14:46.219
Seriously? Seafood congee again?

200
14:46.219 --> 14:48.699
I'm sick of it.

201
14:48.699 --> 14:51.300
You might be, but someone else isn't.

202
14:55.180 --> 14:58.340
Why is all the fruit Zhao Sheng Ge likes?

203
14:58.340 --> 14:59.379
Is it?

204
14:59.379 --> 15:01.660
What a coincidence.

205
15:01.660 --> 15:02.739
You Ming.

206
15:02.739 --> 15:06.339
Your club could do with better service.

207
15:06.339 --> 15:07.500
Not at all.

208
15:07.500 --> 15:09.940
Our friends are simply kind to us.

209
15:12.420 --> 15:13.619
Right.

210
15:13.619 --> 15:16.340
They certainly are.

211
15:17.060 --> 15:18.099
Ying.

212
15:18.099 --> 15:19.579
You've been busy lately.

213
15:19.579 --> 15:22.739
Are you preparing an exhibition for Rong Bao Zhai's auction?

214
15:22.739 --> 15:24.939
You are well informed, Mr. Tan.

215
15:24.939 --> 15:26.899
It's a blue-and-white porcelain sale.

216
15:26.899 --> 15:27.899
Why?

217
15:27.899 --> 15:30.579
Are you interested in it too, Mr. Tan?

218
15:30.579 --> 15:31.660
No.

219
15:31.660 --> 15:32.780
I'm not interested.

220
15:32.780 --> 15:34.979
Zhao Sheng Ge might be.

221
15:34.979 --> 15:37.099
His family loves collecting it.

222
15:37.099 --> 15:39.380
What's his name? Huan Yun He?

223
15:39.380 --> 15:42.020
He might belong to some faction.

224
15:42.020 --> 15:45.260
Apparently one faction has already split into two.

225
15:45.260 --> 15:46.699
The second-in-command wants the top job,

226
15:46.699 --> 15:49.420
but no one respects him.

227
15:49.420 --> 15:50.699
I heard Mrs. Mai

228
15:50.699 --> 15:54.220
still protests outside Minglong Tower every day.

229
15:56.140 --> 15:58.339
Mrs. Mai went quiet for a few days.

230
15:58.339 --> 16:00.020
Now, she's suddenly causing trouble again.

231
16:00.020 --> 16:02.260
Someone must be pulling the strings.

232
16:02.260 --> 16:04.260
If there's no inside story,

233
16:04.260 --> 16:06.260
my surname isn't Zhuo.

234
16:06.260 --> 16:08.219
You'll ditch your surname?

235
16:08.219 --> 16:10.819
Then take mine, Tan.

236
16:10.819 --> 16:13.420
The latest story is that before Mai Jia Hui jumped,

237
16:13.420 --> 16:15.459
Zhao Sheng Ge made the final call.

238
16:15.459 --> 16:17.619
Now everyone in Hai City is terrified,

239
16:17.619 --> 16:21.220
dreading a deadly call from Mr. Zhao.

240
16:25.300 --> 16:27.180
I made no such call.

241
16:28.180 --> 16:31.979
We simply chose different ways to fulfill the contract.

242
16:31.979 --> 16:35.459
That's what I said. These tabloids make up utter rubbish.

243
16:35.459 --> 16:37.660
Sheng would never make that call.

244
16:37.660 --> 16:39.099
Wan.

245
16:39.099 --> 16:40.459
What?

246
16:40.459 --> 16:41.859
Did that frighten you?

247
16:41.859 --> 16:46.700
Do you really think he caused Mai Jia Hui's death?

248
16:47.699 --> 16:49.780
No.

249
16:49.780 --> 16:51.659
Mr. Zhao isn't that sort of man.

250
17:04.099 --> 17:06.540
Mr. Zhao, we've contacted Officer He.

251
17:06.540 --> 17:08.619
Do you want to continue investigating Mr. Chen?

252
17:08.619 --> 17:10.459
This tea is quite good.

253
17:10.459 --> 17:12.579
But compared with the tea at Sheng's company,

254
17:12.579 --> 17:13.580
it's a bit weak.

255
17:13.580 --> 17:14.740
Proceed.

256
17:16.179 --> 17:18.099
I think it's just right.

257
17:18.099 --> 17:19.500
Your stomach's been bad lately.

258
17:19.500 --> 17:20.780
Don't drink strong tea.

259
17:20.780 --> 17:22.259
This is perfect for you.

260
17:22.259 --> 17:23.659
Lukas.

261
17:23.659 --> 17:24.659
Mr. Tan.

262
17:24.659 --> 17:26.300
Your boss has a bad stomach.

263
17:26.300 --> 17:27.460
Stop making his tea so strong.

264
17:27.460 --> 17:29.219
Learn from Wan.

265
17:29.219 --> 17:31.099
You're right, Mr. Tan. I was careless.

266
17:31.099 --> 17:32.379
You're having me on, Mr. Tan.

267
17:32.379 --> 17:34.260
I'm hardly good enough to teach anyone.

268
17:34.260 --> 17:35.580
It was just a coincidence.

269
17:45.500 --> 17:46.859
- Cheers. - Cheers.

270
17:46.859 --> 17:48.139
Cheers.

271
17:48.139 --> 17:49.220
Mr. Zhao.

272
17:49.220 --> 17:51.139
I hope we can count on your support.

273
17:51.139 --> 17:52.259
We must work together more.

274
17:52.259 --> 17:54.780
Cheers.

275
17:54.780 --> 17:56.300
You go over, too.

276
17:56.300 --> 17:59.339
It's the perfect chance to drink with him openly.

277
17:59.339 --> 18:01.659
Mr. Zhao, a toast to you.

278
18:01.659 --> 18:03.580
Go on.

279
18:05.980 --> 18:08.899
- All right. - Cheers.

280
18:08.899 --> 18:09.899
Cheers.

281
18:09.899 --> 18:12.179
I look forward to your support, Mr. Zhao.

282
18:14.379 --> 18:16.020
A toast to you, Mr. Zhao.

283
18:16.020 --> 18:17.659
Cheers.

284
18:20.899 --> 18:22.819
Let's go.

285
18:22.819 --> 18:24.379
Leaving already?

286
18:36.700 --> 18:38.419
Why aren't you eating today?

287
18:38.419 --> 18:39.899
Is the food bad...

288
18:40.859 --> 18:43.500
or are you not in the mood?

289
18:44.379 --> 18:45.699
I'm all right.

290
18:48.940 --> 18:52.379
Bring me a case if you get one.

291
19:16.220 --> 19:18.020
Mr. Chen.

292
19:18.020 --> 19:19.740
Mr. Chen.

293
19:21.980 --> 19:24.060
Sorry to trouble you again today.

294
19:24.740 --> 19:25.819
Not at all.

295
19:25.819 --> 19:27.100
One more thing.

296
19:28.659 --> 19:30.339
Could you wrap this for me, please?

297
19:30.339 --> 19:31.979
Give it to Mr. Zhao's assistant.

298
19:31.979 --> 19:33.060
Of course, Mr. Chen.

299
19:33.060 --> 19:34.419
I'll see to it at once.

300
19:34.419 --> 19:36.219
Thanks.

301
19:53.419 --> 19:54.859
Chen Wan.

302
19:54.859 --> 19:56.740
I haven't got a lighter.

303
19:58.859 --> 20:00.220
Mr. Chen.

304
20:00.220 --> 20:01.659
Mr. Chen.

305
20:04.060 --> 20:05.260
I couldn't find him.

306
20:05.260 --> 20:07.060
I couldn't reach the other party.

307
20:07.060 --> 20:08.139
It's all right.

308
20:08.139 --> 20:10.300
This guest is rather hard to find.

309
20:10.300 --> 20:12.540
Give it to me. Thanks for your trouble.

310
20:23.940 --> 20:26.619
Sir, shall we go?

311
20:27.819 --> 20:29.179
Hang on.

312
20:31.859 --> 20:33.500
Your restaurant is excellent.

313
20:33.500 --> 20:35.860
I have high hopes for you. You've got a bright future.

314
20:36.780 --> 20:38.379
Mr. Zhuo, we're off.

315
20:38.379 --> 20:40.780
Honored to have you here. Come again.

316
20:41.899 --> 20:43.300
Xuan.

317
20:44.179 --> 20:45.659
What?

318
20:45.659 --> 20:47.139
A cigarette case and lighter.

319
20:47.139 --> 20:48.939
Give them to Zhao Sheng Ge for me.

320
20:52.220 --> 20:54.899
Why not give them to him yourself?

321
20:56.060 --> 20:57.339
No need for that.

322
20:57.339 --> 21:00.260
If he asks, don't say I found them.

323
21:00.260 --> 21:01.859
Say you did.

324
21:01.859 --> 21:02.859
Don't mention me at all.

325
21:02.859 --> 21:04.740
Are you mad?

326
21:04.740 --> 21:08.220
No need for all this, yet you still love him.

327
21:08.220 --> 21:10.179
I do love him.

328
21:10.179 --> 21:12.419
That doesn't mean I'll pursue him.

329
21:14.659 --> 21:16.020
But...

330
21:16.859 --> 21:19.820
Have you honestly never thought that

331
21:20.859 --> 21:24.500
all you've done for him is like charity?

332
21:24.500 --> 21:26.339
I'm not pursuing him.

333
21:26.339 --> 21:29.099
But that doesn't clash with wanting

334
21:29.099 --> 21:31.300
to do something for the man I love

335
21:31.300 --> 21:32.979
or see him from afar, does it?

336
21:35.420 --> 21:36.460
Fine.

337
21:36.460 --> 21:39.619
All right, you great philanthropist.

338
21:40.740 --> 21:42.060
Right, I'm off.

339
21:42.060 --> 21:44.020
- Bye. - All right.

340
21:56.327 --> 21:58.179
Hello, Sheng?

341
21:58.179 --> 21:59.659
Where are you?

342
22:00.260 --> 22:01.260
You haven't left yet?

343
22:01.260 --> 22:02.379
Good.

344
22:02.379 --> 22:04.540
Right. Wait for me.

345
22:15.419 --> 22:16.419
What's the matter?

346
22:16.419 --> 22:19.060
I was... just about to leave.

347
22:19.060 --> 22:21.060
I saw that you'd left this behind.

348
22:21.060 --> 22:22.300
So...

349
22:22.300 --> 22:24.219
Good thing you're still here.

350
22:31.260 --> 22:34.500
After all these years, Zhuo Zhi Xuan...

351
22:34.500 --> 22:36.980
You haven't changed a bit.

352
22:36.980 --> 22:39.220
Did you find this?

353
22:39.220 --> 22:40.699
Yes.

354
22:50.740 --> 22:52.340
I'll drink to you.

355
22:54.139 --> 22:55.179
Really?

356
22:55.179 --> 22:56.419
Yes.

357
22:57.020 --> 22:59.579
Of course I did.

358
22:59.579 --> 23:01.379
Thank you for the trouble.

359
23:01.379 --> 23:03.100
Not at all.

360
23:04.659 --> 23:05.780
Lovely hotel.

361
23:05.780 --> 23:07.139
Best of luck with it.

362
23:07.139 --> 23:08.659
Come often.

363
23:13.899 --> 23:15.251
Let's go.

364
23:32.379 --> 23:33.419
Chen Wan.

365
23:33.419 --> 23:35.339
That scared me to death.

366
23:35.339 --> 23:38.579
You made me lie to Zhao Sheng Ge's face.

367
23:38.579 --> 23:40.980
I must owe you from a past life.

368
23:40.980 --> 23:42.380
A huge favor.

369
23:42.380 --> 23:44.619
I must've owed you in my last life, too.

370
23:45.941 --> 23:48.541
Think about how you'll repay me.

371
23:52.819 --> 23:55.339
Is that knackered old BYD fixed yet?

372
23:55.339 --> 23:56.340
It's fixed.

373
23:56.340 --> 23:58.659
I drove it out to finish the paperwork.

374
24:01.460 --> 24:02.700
Stop the car.

375
24:02.700 --> 24:03.939
Here?

376
24:03.939 --> 24:05.859
That's right.

377
24:05.859 --> 24:09.780
Sir, we're tight on time for Eagle Nest.

378
24:09.780 --> 24:11.139
No problem.

379
24:13.220 --> 24:15.619
Your car may be old, but it's known for being reliable.

380
24:15.619 --> 24:17.500
How did you make the engine overheat that badly?

381
24:17.500 --> 24:19.459
I ran into a nutter.

382
24:23.339 --> 24:24.500
Zhao Sheng Ge.

383
24:24.500 --> 24:26.820
I've got something to do. Bye.

384
24:49.579 --> 24:50.899
Mr. Zhao.

385
24:50.899 --> 24:51.980
I'm Chen Wan.

386
24:51.980 --> 24:55.219
We met at Mr. Zhuo's hotel.

387
24:58.020 --> 24:59.860
My car broke down?

388
25:01.940 --> 25:02.979
Are you in a hurry?

389
25:02.979 --> 25:05.300
You can take my car if you are.

390
25:05.300 --> 25:06.540
Would that be all right?

391
25:06.540 --> 25:08.780
- Where are you going? - Eagle Nest.

392
25:08.780 --> 25:11.100
I'll take you. This way.

393
25:38.819 --> 25:41.579
Mr. Zhao, sorry that the car's rather small.

394
25:41.579 --> 25:43.460
There's water beside you.

395
25:43.460 --> 25:45.260
Thank you.

396
25:46.780 --> 25:49.500
Is the temperature all right, Mr. Zhao?

397
26:40.099 --> 26:42.419
Bad traffic. I'm almost there.

398
26:58.500 --> 27:01.099
Don't drop me at the main entrance.

399
27:01.099 --> 27:03.540
Which entrance would you prefer?

400
27:03.540 --> 27:05.460
Which do you think is best?

401
27:05.460 --> 27:06.740
Drop me wherever parking is easiest.

402
27:06.740 --> 27:08.500
I'll get out there.

403
27:10.139 --> 27:12.859
Shui Gate, Yu Gate, or Kun Gate.

404
27:12.859 --> 27:14.579
Shui Gate is the hub.

405
27:14.579 --> 27:16.780
The private lift is just inside.

406
27:16.780 --> 27:18.339
It goes wherever he wants,

407
27:18.339 --> 27:19.780
so it's most convenient.

408
27:20.419 --> 27:22.099
I'll drop you at Shui Gate.

409
27:22.099 --> 27:24.540
It's handy for getting anywhere.

410
27:24.540 --> 27:27.179
You know the place well.

411
27:27.179 --> 27:28.459
Thanks.

412
27:32.339 --> 27:34.179
Take care, Mr. Zhao.

413
28:00.419 --> 28:02.100
Go to Kun Gate.

414
28:02.899 --> 28:05.340
Any result on Chen Wan?

415
28:13.500 --> 28:14.939
Mr. Zhao.

416
28:16.020 --> 28:18.099
Mr. Shao.

417
28:18.099 --> 28:19.500
No assistant?

418
28:19.500 --> 28:21.580
- I don't need one. - Right.

419
28:27.540 --> 28:30.100
- Wine, please. - Pour him some wine.

420
28:32.099 --> 28:34.260
Mr. Zhao, you don't like this?

421
28:34.260 --> 28:36.099
I chose it especially for you, Mr. Zhao.

422
28:36.099 --> 28:37.939
That's very thoughtful, Mr. Shao.

423
28:41.700 --> 28:43.179
Mr. Zhao.

424
28:45.139 --> 28:47.219
Pull your sleeve down.

425
28:50.339 --> 28:51.740
Mr. Zhao.

426
28:56.700 --> 29:00.659
I heard your boss passed away two days ago.

427
29:00.659 --> 29:02.579
Life is unpredictable.

428
29:02.579 --> 29:06.980
Those of us beneath him are rather anxious now.

429
29:06.980 --> 29:09.379
Business is difficult these days.

430
29:09.379 --> 29:10.500
It depends whether you'll let us earn a living.

431
29:10.500 --> 29:12.540
Will you, Mr. Zhao?

432
29:12.540 --> 29:14.419
I do have a way forward.

433
29:14.419 --> 29:16.659
I don't know whether you'll take it, Mr. Shao.

434
29:16.659 --> 29:18.060
If you'll do me the honor,

435
29:18.060 --> 29:20.099
I'll be happy to listen.

436
29:20.099 --> 29:23.619
All roads lead to Lychee Bay.

437
29:39.099 --> 29:43.419
I... I acted normal just now, didn't I?

438
29:50.659 --> 29:52.220
Out here in the game,

439
29:52.220 --> 29:55.500
showing each other respect beats fighting and killing.

440
29:55.500 --> 29:57.020
A smooth transition for Lychee Bay

441
29:57.020 --> 29:58.899
was my brother's dying wish.

442
29:58.899 --> 30:02.379
His wish can only be fulfilled by me.

443
30:02.379 --> 30:04.659
Reclaiming land for a port at Lychee Bay

444
30:04.659 --> 30:06.939
will benefit the country and its people.

445
30:08.659 --> 30:10.339
I've lived by one rule

446
30:10.339 --> 30:13.020
through all my years in this life.

447
30:13.020 --> 30:16.300
Just one principle... peace above all.

448
30:16.300 --> 30:17.899
However, the money...

449
30:17.899 --> 30:19.699
You'll get your share.

450
30:20.700 --> 30:23.459
It's a pleasure doing business with you, Mr. Zhao.

451
30:25.899 --> 30:26.900
Mr. Zhao.

452
30:26.900 --> 30:29.060
I've arranged some entertainment for you.

453
30:29.060 --> 30:30.339
All beautiful young ladies.

454
30:30.339 --> 30:32.460
I've other business. I'll leave you to it.

455
30:32.460 --> 30:35.260
Mr. Zhao, do they not take your fancy,

456
30:35.260 --> 30:36.659
or is your heart already taken?

457
30:36.659 --> 30:39.099
If it is, then I've overstepped.

458
30:39.099 --> 30:40.500
Please forgive me.

459
30:40.500 --> 30:42.899
You think too much, Mr. Shao.

460
30:42.899 --> 30:44.780
Just get the job done.

461
30:44.780 --> 30:46.379
Then you'll have earned the credit.

462
30:47.700 --> 30:49.540
- I'll see you out. - No need.

463
30:49.540 --> 30:50.859
I couldn't possibly let you go alone.

464
30:50.859 --> 30:52.540
Please.

465
30:52.540 --> 30:54.020
You don't have to bother.

466
31:26.899 --> 31:28.780
Mr. Chen Wan?

467
31:28.780 --> 31:30.819
Mr. Chen, please assist us with an investigation.

468
31:30.819 --> 31:32.220
This way.
